@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Без ключа → 400 missing-idempotency-key
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"merchant_id":"m-1","amount_minor":100,"currency":"RUB"}

### Создать платёж → 201
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: k1

{"merchant_id":"m-1","amount_minor":100,"currency":"RUB"}

### Повтор с тем же ключом → 201, тот же id, Idempotent-Replayed: true
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: k1

{"merchant_id":"m-1","amount_minor":100,"currency":"RUB"}

### Тот же ключ, другая сумма → 422 idempotency-key-reused
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: k1

{"merchant_id":"m-1","amount_minor":999,"currency":"RUB"}

### Получить созданный платёж → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/payments/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Каждый раз новый ключ → всегда новый платёж
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"merchant_id":"m-1","amount_minor":100,"currency":"RUB"}